{"id":"wb-6-501","name":"圣水寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"圣水寺 (葫芦岛)","text":"圣水寺位于中国辽宁省葫芦岛市连山区杨家杖子真莲花山南麓，是集儒释道三教于一体的古建筑群，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n圣水寺建于清康熙五十九年（1720年），坐北朝南，占地1万余平方米，建筑面积3356平方米。中轴线有天元宫（山门）、碧云宫、钟鼓楼、明心楼、正殿，东院有山门、无梁殿、寝室，西院有山门、九间殿、三霄殿、万仙聚会殿等建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E6%B0%B4%E5%AF%BA_(%E8%91%AB%E8%8A%A6%E5%B2%9B)","revisionId":86783991,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783991","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e804db25fac60c84a7e8c96b.jpg","title":"莲花山圣水寺.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8E%B2%E8%8A%B1%E5%B1%B1%E5%9C%A3%E6%B0%B4%E5%AF%BA.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/%E8%8E%B2%E8%8A%B1%E5%B1%B1%E5%9C%A3%E6%B0%B4%E5%AF%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Sacred Water Temple","width":320,"height":213}}